---
layout: base.njk
title: Bloogsite | Practical Guides for Better Decisions
description: Clear, practical guides across technology, money, careers, health, travel, and modern life—created to help you make informed decisions with confidence.
activeNav: home
---
{% from "article-card.njk" import articleCard %}

<main id="main-content">
<section class="home-brand-strip" aria-label="Bloogsite — {{ site.tagline }}">
<div class="home-brand-lockup">
<span class="home-brand-logo">
<img src="/assets/img/brand/bloogsite-logo-white.png" alt="Bloogsite" width="500" height="250">
</span>
<p>{{ site.tagline }}</p>
</div>
<nav class="home-brand-topics" aria-label="Featured topics">
<span>Explore</span>
<a href="/categories/tech/">Technology</a>
<a href="/categories/finance/">Money</a>
<a href="/categories/tech-jobs/">Careers</a>
<a href="/categories/health/">Health</a>
<a href="/categories/travel/">Travel</a>
<a class="home-brand-more" href="/blogs/">More <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
</nav>
</section>

<section class="hero home-hero" aria-labelledby="home-title">
<div class="hero-text">
<p class="hero-eyebrow">Practical knowledge for modern life</p>
<h1 id="home-title">Discover Amazing Stories Every Day</h1>
<p>{{ site.subline }}</p>
<div class="hero-actions">
<a class="button-link button-primary" href="/blogs/">Explore the blogs</a>
<a class="button-link button-secondary" href="#blogs">Browse topics</a>
</div>
</div>
<figure class="hero-image">
<img src="https://picsum.photos/1400/900" alt="" width="1400" height="900" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
<figcaption class="hero-image-caption"><span aria-hidden="true"></span>A fresh perspective, every visit.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>

<section class="home-value-strip" aria-label="Why read Bloogsite">
<div><strong>10</strong><span>topic areas</span></div>
<div><strong>Clear</strong><span>explanations</span></div>
<div><strong>Source-led</strong><span>guidance</span></div>
<div><strong>Curious</strong><span>readers first</span></div>
</section>

<section class="home-search" aria-labelledby="search-title">
<div class="home-search-heading">
<p class="section-kicker">Find an answer</p>
<h2 id="search-title">What would you like to understand today?</h2>
</div>
<form class="search" role="search" data-search-mode="articles">
<label class="visually-hidden" for="article-search">Search Bloogsite articles</label>
<div class="search-row">
<input id="article-search" type="search" name="query" placeholder="Search AI tools, personal finance, careers, health…" autocomplete="off" aria-controls="article-search-results" aria-describedby="article-search-status">
<button class="search-button" type="submit">Search</button>
</div>
<p id="article-search-status" class="search-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Search the article library by topic, question, or keyword.</p>
</form>
</section>

<section id="article-search-results" class="search-results" aria-label="Article search results" hidden>
<ul id="article-search-list" class="search-results-list"></ul>
</section>
<noscript><p class="search-noscript">Article search requires JavaScript. You can still browse every topic below.</p></noscript>

<section class="home-start" aria-labelledby="start-title">
<div class="home-start-heading">
<p class="section-kicker">Start here</p>
<h2 id="start-title">From curiosity to a clearer next step.</h2>
<p>Bloogsite helps you move from a question to useful understanding without unnecessary complexity.</p>
</div>
<ol class="home-start-steps">
<li>
<span>01</span>
<div><h3>Choose what matters</h3><p>Begin with technology, money, careers, health, travel, or another part of modern life.</p></div>
</li>
<li>
<span>02</span>
<div><h3>Understand the subject</h3><p>Get a clear explanation with practical context, useful comparisons, and reliable sources.</p></div>
</li>
<li>
<span>03</span>
<div><h3>Move forward confidently</h3><p>Use the key ideas and next steps to make a better-informed everyday decision.</p></div>
</li>
</ol>
</section>

{% if collections.posts | length %}
<section class="featured-section" aria-labelledby="featured-title">
<div class="section-heading">
<div>
<p class="section-kicker">Fresh from Bloogsite</p>
<h2 id="featured-title">Latest practical guides</h2>
</div>
<a href="/categories/" class="view-all-link">Explore every topic →</a>
</div>
<div class="blogs">
{% for post in collections.posts | limit(3) %}
{{ articleCard(post, categories) }}
{% endfor %}
</div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section class="home-blog-directory" id="blogs" aria-labelledby="blogs-title">
<div class="home-blog-heading">
<div><p class="section-kicker">The Bloogsite library</p><h2 id="blogs-title">Blogs</h2></div>
<a href="/blogs/">View the complete blog →</a>
</div>
<p class="home-blog-intro">Choose a subject and find clear, practical guidance for the decisions that matter to you.</p>
<div class="home-blog-topics">
{% for cat in categories %}
<a href="/categories/{{ cat.slug }}/">
<span class="home-blog-topic-icon" style="background:{{ cat.bg }};color:{{ cat.color }};">
<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">{{ cat.icon | safe }}</svg>
</span>
<span><strong>{{ cat.name }}</strong><small>Browse guides</small></span>
<span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
</a>
{% endfor %}
</div>
</section>

<section class="editorial-promise" aria-labelledby="promise-title">
<div class="promise-intro">
<p class="section-kicker">The Bloogsite standard</p>
<h2 id="promise-title">Useful information, thoughtfully explained.</h2>
<p>Bloogsite turns complicated subjects into practical guidance you can understand and use.</p>
</div>
<div class="promise-grid">
<article><span aria-hidden="true">01</span><h3>Clear before clever</h3><p>Plain language, useful structure, and enough context to understand what matters.</p></article>
<article><span aria-hidden="true">02</span><h3>Practical by design</h3><p>Actionable guidance that helps you compare options and make confident decisions.</p></article>
<article><span aria-hidden="true">03</span><h3>Built on trust</h3><p>Visible authorship, publication dates, and source references wherever accuracy demands them.</p></article>
</div>
</section>

<section class="founder-section" aria-labelledby="community-title">
<div class="founder-mark" aria-hidden="true">
<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
<path d="M3.5 5.5c2.9-.8 5.6-.2 8.5 1.7v12c-2.9-1.9-5.6-2.5-8.5-1.7z"/>
<path d="M20.5 5.5c-2.9-.8-5.6-.2-8.5 1.7v12c2.9-1.9 5.6-2.5 8.5-1.7z"/>
<path d="M12 7.2v12"/>
</svg>
</div>
<div>
<p class="section-kicker">Built for curious readers</p>
<h2 id="community-title">Keep learning. Make every decision count.</h2>
<p>Explore practical answers across technology, money, careers, health, travel, and everyday life, then follow Bloogsite for useful ideas as they are published.</p>
<div class="community-actions">
<a href="/blogs/">Explore the latest guides →</a>
<a href="https://www.instagram.com/badass_technologia/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Follow on Instagram →</a>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</main>

<script src="/assets/js/site-search.js" defer></script>
